  <item>
    <title>vol.61 我的幸福来敲门！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ac4edf6e742e36efcbef64e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ac4edf6e742e36efcbef64e</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 12:53:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是一期以”幸福”为主题的闲聊播客。四位老友聚在涮肉开聊，从刚过去的教师节切入，追忆大学课堂睡觉、食堂肉夹馍、宿舍看电影的青春往事；随后聊到各自现在的骑行爱好、婚姻日常和职场状态，探讨”什么是幸福”；最后展望退休计划和”中国梦”。</span></p><p><strong><span>开场：鸭肉胡同涮肉与嘉宾登场&nbsp;(</span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span></strong><strong><span>)</span></strong></p><p><span>•&nbsp;边涮羊肉边闲聊</span></p><p><strong><span>追忆过去：教师节与大学老师&nbsp;(</span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="313">05:13</a></span></strong><strong><span>)</span></strong></p><p><span>•&nbsp;大A是”学神”，其他人是”课堂睡觉专业户”</span></p><p><strong><span>校园生存指南：早餐、课堂与宿舍&nbsp;(</span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a></span></strong><strong><span>)</span></strong></p><p><span>•&nbsp;食堂肉夹馍2.5块、小笼包、麻辣香锅，自助涮肉被吃倒闭</span></p><p><strong><span>评说现在：小春的骑行日常&nbsp;(</span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a></span></strong><strong><span>)</span></strong></p><p><span>•&nbsp;从”上课睡觉少年”变成”六点起床骑行者”</span></p><p><strong><span>婚姻与幸福：大A的家长里短&nbsp;(</span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2160">36:00</a></span></strong><strong><span>)</span></strong></p><p><span>•&nbsp;做饭谁刷碗的哲学辩论</span></p><p><strong><span>展望未来：踮起脚尖的幸福&nbsp;(</span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3120">52:00</a></span></strong><strong><span>)</span></strong></p><p><span>•&nbsp;幸福生活从哪里来？过去现在和将来</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/637c8a0b3fece2cc4c86a7ba/lq5K1Tyn8MthX2OXie-y3jWIRfSu.m4a" length="69066341" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:11:10</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqJSPf-Zl8n2vp70k8l6OPEcQF2c.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
